{"id":"n35065-1-10","stage":5,"title":"귓속말 · 耳语","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35065-1-10-1","ko":"맨 뒤에 앉은 학생은 무슨 일로 수업 시간에 옆 사람에게 귓속말을 하는 건가?","zh":"坐在最后面的那个学生，上课时为什么要跟旁边的人说悄悄话呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맨","meaning":"最，头","explanation":"맨：最，头","readings":[{"term":"맨","audio":"/audio/7ec4b331b5617833973d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65109","senseId":"1","lemma":"맨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맨","audio":"/audio/7ec4b331b5617833973d.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에","audio":"/audio/0350898692fd4601facb.mp3"}},{"text":"앉은","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉은","audio":"/audio/b98c95bcfcd444b7b080.mp3"}},{"text":"학생은","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생은","audio":"/audio/35bbc601fa4febb7e967.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일로","audio":"/audio/4e811c112d2037a911d7.mp3"}},{"text":"수업","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간에","audio":"/audio/6e584c2e1ef26484da55.mp3"}},{"text":"옆","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}},{"text":"사람에게","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람에게","audio":"/audio/d740a3c3d3a8a5c9c386.mp3"}},{"text":"귓속말을","meaning":"耳语，私语，悄悄话","explanation":"귓속말：耳语，私语，悄悄话；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"귓속말","audio":"/audio/617cc055860b05c28513.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35065","senseId":"1","lemma":"귓속말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귓속말을","audio":"/audio/c34a92155f6bef4f850f.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audi